  "details": "currently you can see the friends list and worlds on the website. Thats great, but it happens, that I want to show my RL friends my avatars, wich is currently not possible.\n\nAlso cool would be, if we could manage the avatars on the website (changing tags, name, description and deleting it).\n\nA nice bonus would be, if someone built a unity webGL app, that can load a avatar and allow the user to rotate around it, and maybe show the gestures and emotes.",
